01:08:05.201 --> 01:08:07.795
Sit here.
If the team leader comes...

547
01:08:07.870 --> 01:08:11.237
- just pretend you are on a call
doing an upgrade for-
- Friends and Family. I know.

548
01:08:11.307 --> 01:08:13.298
- Yah.
- Two minutes.

549
01:08:13.375 --> 01:08:14.865
Ah.

550
01:08:18.781 --> 01:08:21.079
<i>Who Wants to Be a Millionaire?</i>

551
01:08:21.150 --> 01:08:23.914
<i>Dial this number now.</i>

552
01:08:23.986 --> 01:08:27.979
<i>Answer this question.</i>
<i>What does "A.T.M."-</i>

