01:08:28.057 --> 01:08:30.150
Hello? Hello? Hello?

554
01:08:30.226 --> 01:08:33.559
I would like to be a contestant
on <i>Who Wants to Be a Millionaire?</i>

555
01:08:33.629 --> 01:08:35.927
- <i> Hello? I want to be on-</i>
- <i>Uh-</i>

556
