Mrs. Mackintosh
from..."King-uss-ie."

565
01:09:04.760 --> 01:09:08.924
<i>It's Kingussie. love.</i>
<i>Pronounced "Kingussie."</i>

566
01:09:08.998 --> 01:09:11.762
So where are you from?
Abroad. I bet.

567
01:09:11.834 --> 01:09:15.099
Uh. just down the road
from your house. Mrs. Mackintosh.

568
01:09:15.170 --> 01:09:16.797
Uh. next to the loch.

569
01:09:16.872 --> 01:09:19.636
<i>Och aye?</i>
<i>Which loch?</i>

570
01:09:19.708 --> 01:09:21.767
Loch-

571
01:09:21.844 --> 01:09:25.405
Loch- Big... Loch Ben.

572
01:09:25.481 --> 01:09:29.247
Loch Big Ben. Next door
