Who is this?
Do you know what time is this?

576
01:10:30.713 --> 01:10:35.116
Hello?

577
01:10:47.930 --> 01:10:51.798
Hello? Hello?

578
01:10:51.867 --> 01:10:54.301
<i>Who is this?</i>

579
01:10:56.438 --> 01:10:59.202
I'm calling from
XL 5 Communications. sir.

580
01:10:59.274 --> 01:11:01.742
As a valued customer.
we are offering you a free upgrade...

581
