<i>That used to be our slum.</i>

622
01:14:31.453 --> 01:14:33.421
Can you believe that. huh?

623
01:14:33.488 --> 01:14:36.423
We used to live right there. man.

624
01:14:38.594 --> 01:14:41.563
Now it's all business.

625
01:14:41.630 --> 01:14:45.430
India is at the center
of the world hub. bhai.

626
01:14:45.500 --> 01:14:47.434
And I-

627
01:14:47.502 --> 01:14:49.470
I am at the center...

628
01:14:49.538 --> 01:14:51.802
of the center.

629
