- Sorry.

631
01:15:01.383 --> 01:15:03.613
<i> The gangster from our slum?</i>
<i>You work for him?</i>

632
01:15:03.685 --> 01:15:07.451
Come on. Who else do you think would
save us from Maman's guys. huh?

633
01:15:07.522 --> 01:15:09.490
