634
01:15:11.627 --> 01:15:13.561
Anything he asks.

635
01:15:21.336 --> 01:15:24.533
He's coming.
You need to go now.

636
01:15:24.606 --> 01:15:27.473
- Take my card.
- What for?

637
01:15:27.542 --> 01:15:30.670
You think I'm gonna let you
out of my sights again. huh?

638
01:15:30.746 --> 01:15:32.805
You stay with me now.
younger brother.

639
01:15:32.881 --> 01:15:35.315
Now go- my place.

640
01:15:35.384 --> 01:15:38.478
Salim. where is Latika?

641
01:15:38.553 --> 01:15:40.578
Still?

642
01:15:44.059 --> 01:15:48.792
She's gone. Brother.
Long gone. Now go.

643
01:15:48.864 --> 01:15:51.389
Go to my place.

644
01:16:13.422 --> 01:16:15.356
- <i># Hey #</i>
- Hello?

645
01:16:15.424 --> 01:16:17.221
Okay. I'll be right there.

646
01:17:03.138 --> 01:17:05.072
<i># Hey #</i>

647
01:17:06.174 --> 01:17:08.074
<i># Hey #</i>

648
01:17:08.143 --> 01:17:10.008
<i># Hey #</i>

649
01:17:11.079 --> 01:17:12.444
<i># Hey #</i>

650
01:17:33.135 --> 01:17:35.069
<i># Hey #</i>

651
01:17:36.138 --> 01:17:37.867
<i># Hey ##</i>

652
01:17:37.939 --> 01:17:40.737
I'm the new cook from the agency.
A thousand apologies.

653
01:17:40.809 --> 01:17:43.334
I am so late for the memsahib.

654
01:17:43.412 --> 01:17:45.346
Just a minute.

655
01:17:58.660 --> 01:18:00.890
<i> Excuse me.</i>

656
01:18:00.962 --> 01:18:03.328
<i>Excuse me.</i>

657
01:18:03.398 --> 01:18:05.958
<i>There's nothing about any cook.</i>

658
01:18:06.034 --> 01:18:08.229
There is a dishwasher being delivered.

659
01:18:08.303 --> 01:18:10.567
Do you know anything about that?

660
