<i>I want to bet five lakh rupees</i>
<i>he'll make a century.</i>

687
01:21:30.538 --> 01:21:33.166
Ah! Make it seven then.

688
01:21:33.241 --> 01:21:35.471
Mm. Yeah.

689
01:21:37.712 --> 01:21:39.646
Come away with me.

690
