701
01:22:33.735 --> 01:22:36.033
- Do you think he'd tell me?
- <i> No.</i>

702
01:22:36.104 --> 01:22:38.595
Not the second- No!
No! No!

703
01:22:38.673 --> 01:22:41.233
And could that be
a hundred for Tendulkar?

704
01:22:41.309 --> 01:22:44.608
To the third umpire. Billy Bowden.

705
01:22:44.679 --> 01:22:46.613
<i>Takes the fielder on.</i>

706
01:22:46.681 --> 01:22:48.672
<i>In the deep.</i>
<i>That's a good throw.</i>

707
01:22:48.750 --> 01:22:50.945
