centuries in history?

723
01:23:57.719 --> 01:24:00.119
"A." Sachin Tendulkar...

724
01:24:00.188 --> 01:24:02.179
"B." Ricky Ponting...

725
01:24:02.257 --> 01:24:04.191
"C." Michael Slater...

726
01:24:04.259 --> 01:24:06.955
or "D."Jack Hobbs?

727
01:24:09.264 --> 01:24:13.257
<i>But remember. if you answer wrong...</i>

728
01:24:13.334 --> 01:24:17.600
you lose everything-
just like this.

729
01:24:20.074 --> 01:24:22.508
So do you want to do this?

730
01:24:39.561 --> 01:24:41.927
<i>That's the way. Jamal!</i>

731
01:24:47.035 --> 01:24:49.265
Dreams of so many...

732
01:24:50.939 --> 01:24:53.100
on the floor.

733
01:26:10.718 --> 01:26:12.982
